{"type":"message","id":"e576dccb","parentId":"444abda3","timestamp":"2026-05-22T07:54:33.663Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_klKPKblIFsiqqNjEbTwrMJJr","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport requests, xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, html, re, json, sys\nfrom urllib.parse import urlparse\nUA='Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; OpenClawScout/1.0)'\nfeeds={\n 'CoinDesk':'https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/',\n 'CoinTelegraph':'https://cointelegraph.com/rss',\n 'Decrypt':'https://decrypt.co/feed',\n 'Google News':'https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=cryptocurrency+OR+blockchain+OR+ethereum+OR+solana+OR+altcoin+OR+%22digital+assets%22+OR+XRP+OR+cardano+-dogecoin+-shiba+-pepe+-floki+-bonk+-wif+-memecoin+-%22meme+coin%22&hl=en-US&gl=US&ceid=US:en',\n 'BeInCrypto':'https://beincrypto.com/feed/',\n 'The Block':'https://www.theblock.co/rss.xml',\n 'CryptoSlate':'https://cryptoslate.com/feed/',\n 'CryptoFox Markets':'https://cryptofox.news/rss/markets/',\n 'CryptoFox Regulation':'https://cryptofox.news/rss/regulation/',\n}\n\ndef clean(s):\n    if not s: return ''\n    s=html.unescape(s)\n    s=re.sub(r'<[^>]+>',' ',s)\n    s=re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',s).strip()\n    return s\nfor name,url in feeds.items():\n    print('\\n##',name,'=>',url)\n    try:\n        r=requests.get(url,headers={'User-Agent':UA},timeout=20)\n        print('STATUS',r.status_code,'CT',r.headers.get('content-type'))\n        text=r.text\n        print('HEAD',text[:120].replace('\\n',' '))\n        if r.status_code!=200 or not text.lstrip().startswith('<'):\n            continue\n        try:\n            root=ET.fromstring(text)\n        except Exception as e:\n            print('PARSE_ERR',e)\n            continue\n        if root.tag.endswith('feed'):\n            entries=root.findall('{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}entry')\n            for e in entries[:5]:\n                title=clean(e.findtext('{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}title'))\n                link=''\n                for l in e.findall('{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}link'):\n                    if l.attrib.get('rel','alternate')=='alternate':\n                        link=l.attrib.get('href',''); break\n                date=e.findtext('{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}updated') or e.findtext('{http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom}published')\n                print('-',date,'|',title[:140])\n                print(' ',link)\n        else:\n            ch=root.find('channel')\n            items=ch.findall('item') if ch is not None else []\n            for it in items[:5]:\n                title=clean(it.findtext('title'))\n                link=it.findtext('link') or ''\n                date=it.findtext('pubDate')\n                print('-',date,'|',title[:140])\n                print(' ',link)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print('ERR',e)\nPY","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher","yieldMs":20000,"timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2468,"output":1063,"cacheRead":25472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29003,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779436461012,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DiF02XkwK2gOhxi74F8IeZYsnnLfq"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b62ed4d6","parentId":"e576dccb","timestamp":"2026-05-22T07:54:42.223Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_klKPKblIFsiqqNjEbTwrMJJr","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## CoinDesk => https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\nSTATUS 200 CT application/xml\nHEAD <?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?> <rss xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://w\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 06:36:18 +0000 | XRP ETFs attract inflows amid wallet surge. bitcoin, ether funds struggle.\n  https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/xrp-funds-sees-fresh-inflows-and-wallet-spike-as-bitcoin-ether-funds-bleed\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 05:38:22 +0000 | Bitcoin trades near $77,700 as analysts eye $75,000 support after liquidation wave\n  https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/bitcoin-trades-near-usd77-700-as-analysts-eye-usd75-000-support-after-liquidation-wave\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 05:14:46 +0000 | India cracks down on prediction markets: Polymarket goes dark, Kalshi could be next\n  https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/india-cracks-down-on-prediction-markets-polymarket-goes-dark-kalshi-could-be-next\n- Thu, 21 May 2026 19:10:03 +0000 | Satoshi’s 1.1 million bitcoin and millions more can be saved from quantum attack, says expert\n  https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/satoshi-s-1-1m-bitcoin-stash-can-be-saved-from-quantum-attack-says-americanfortress\n- Thu, 21 May 2026 17:30:16 +0000 | Mark Cuban says he sold most of his Bitcoin after failed hedge narrative 'disappointed' the billionaire\n  https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/mark-cuban-says-he-sold-most-of-his-bitcoin-after-failed-hedge-narrative-disappointed-the-billionaire\n\n## CoinTelegraph => https://cointelegraph.com/rss\nSTATUS 200 CT application/xml\nHEAD <?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?> <rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 06:56:35 +0000 | Tokenized stocks risk liquidity and revenue fragmentation: Research\n  https://cointelegraph.com/news/tokenized-stocks-risk-liquidity-and-revenue-fragmentation-research?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 06:45:06 +0000 | Galaxy’s Novogratz speaks in court over failed $1.2B BitGo deal: Report\n  https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxys-novogratz-speaks-in-court-on-12b-bitgo-deal-gone-wrong-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 06:35:38 +0000 | SEC's Peirce tempers expectations over tokenized stocks exemption\n  https://cointelegraph.com/news/secs-peirce-tempers-expectations-over-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 05:46:24 +0000 | Coinbase premium hits monthly low as institutional selling pressure mounts\n  https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-premium-hits-monthly-low-as-institutional-selling-pressure-mounts?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\n- Fri, 22 May 2026 04:57:33 +0000 | Accused attackers of Sandbox exec’s wife tried to flee via Uber\n  https://cointelegraph.com/news/uber-getaway-wrench-attack-sandbox-cofounder-wife-france?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\n\n## Decrypt => https://decrypt.co/feed\nSTATUS 200 CT application/xml\nHEAD <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?> <rss   version=\"2.0\"   xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" \n- Thu, 21 May 2026 23:00:04 +0000 | Nearly $500B in Bitcoin Is Exposed to Future Quantum Computing Attacks: Glassnode\n  https://decrypt.co/368721/nearly-500b-bitcoin-exposed-future-quantum-computing-attacks-glassnode\n- Thu, 21 May 2026 22:08:36 +0000 | Prominent Ethereum Dev Proposes $1 Billion ETH Organization With Leader Who 'Wants to Fight'\n  https://decrypt.co/368694/prominent-ethereum-dev-proposes-1-billion-eth-organization\n- Thu, 21 May